# --- Per-user self-learning memory: NEVER publish personal learnings ---
# The committed seed lives in LEARNINGS.template.md. On first run the skill
# copies it to LEARNINGS.md, which stays local to each machine and grows
# only for that user. Keeping it ignored means your private corrections are
# never pushed, and clones start fresh instead of inheriting your learnings.
LEARNINGS.md

